Package: dtlcor
Title: R package for "Multiplicity Control in Oncology Clinical Trials with a Surrogate Endpoint-Based Drop-the-Losers Design"
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Weibin", "Zhong", , "wzhong3@gmu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Jing-ou", "Liu", , " ", role = "aut"),
    person("chenguang", "Wang", , " ", role = "aut"))
Description: This R package is developed based on the manuscript "Multiplicity Control in Oncology Clinical Trials with a Surrogate Endpoint-Based Drop-The-Losers Design". It includes functions to calculate the correlation boundary for the correlation between the response rate and the log-rank test statistic for the binary surrogate endpoint and the time-to-event primary endpoint, as well as functions to conduct simulation studies to obtain design operating characteristics. Additionally, it features an R Shiny application for interactive implementation of the design. 
